  "text": "\n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWapello County, Iowa - County Government\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Clear · 45°\n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Courts\n Employment\n FAQ\n \n\n Translate Language\n \n Translate\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Wapello\nCounty · Iowa\n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Home\n \n\n Departments\n \n \n \n\n American Gothic House\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Board of Supervisors\n Conservation\n Emergency Management\n Environmental Health\n GIS\n Judicial Mental Health Advocate\n Planning and Zoning\n Public Health\n Recorder\n Secondary Roads\n Sheriff and Jail\n Treasurer\n Veterans Affairs\n Weed Commissioner\n \n \n \n\n About\n \n \n \n\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n School Districts\n Township Information\n \n \n Contact\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\nWelcome toWapello County, Iowa\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n Agendas & Minutes \n \n \n\n \n \n Conservation \n \n \n\n \n \n Elections \n \n \n\n \n \n Pay Property Taxes \n \n \n\n \n \n Real Estate Records \n \n \n\n \n \n Renew Vehicle Tags \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \nNews and Announcements\n \n\n \nJob Opening\n \n\n Clerk\n \nposted 10/5/26\n \n \n \n\n \nJob Opening\n \n\n Assistant Wapello County Attorney\n \nposted 7/7/26\n \n \n \n\n \nNews\n \n\n Proposed Property Tax Notice 2026-2027\n \nposted 3/12/26\n \n \n \n\n \nNews\n \n\n Public Hearing Proposed Property Tax Levy 2025-2026\n \nposted 3/14/25\n \n \n \n\n News Employment Bid Notices Notifications\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \nWapello County is administered by a three-member Board of Supervisors who are elected for four-year terms. Other elected officials include the Attorney, Auditor, Recorder, Sheriff, and Treasurer. \n \n\nThe county was created on February 17, 1843, from unorganized territory. The county opened at midnight with several hundred eager settlers camped along the eastern border. Within a month, Wapello County was home to more than 5,000 people. \n \n\nAbout Wapello County \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nWapello County Courthouse\n\n 101 W. 4th St\n\n Ottumwa, IA 52501\n\n Contact Us\n \n\n \nCourthouse Hours\n\n M - F 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\n Closed Holidays\n\n Department Hours May Vary\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Wapello County, Iowa\n \npowered by \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeteran's Day Observed (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving (November 26, 2026)\n \nDay After Thanksgiving (November 27, 2026)\n \nDay Before Christmas Day Observed (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas (December 25, 2026)\n \n\n\n\n\n"
